  "kullanimKosullariMetni": "FITCHECK TERMS OF USE AND SERVICE AGREEMENT\n\nLast Updated: August 27, 2026\n\nPlease read these Terms of Use (\"Agreement\") carefully before using the FitCheck mobile application (\"Application\"). By downloading, accessing, or using the Application, you agree to be bound by all the terms in this Agreement.\n\n1. PARTIES AND PURPOSE\nThis Agreement is concluded between the developer of the FitCheck application and the individual user (\"User\") who downloads and uses the Application. The Application offers digital wardrobe management, clothes tracking, weather-appropriate outfit suggestions, and AI-powered style consulting.\n\n2. SCOPE OF SERVICE AND TERMS OF USE\n• Age Limit: You must be at least 13 years old to use the Application.\n• User Information: The user is responsible for the accuracy of name, gender, style, and color preferences provided during profile setup.\n• Advisory Nature: Style scores, purchasing suggestions, and laundry reminders provided by artificial intelligence are strictly advisory.\n• Weather Data: Weather forecasts are fetched based on real-time location. The Company cannot be held liable for discrepancies.\n\n3. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND CONTENT RIGHTS\nYou retain intellectual property rights to the clothing photos you upload. The FitCheck logo, design, software code, and algorithms belong entirely to FitCheck.\n\n4. PRIVACY AND DATA SECURITY\nYour uploaded photos and outfit history are stored locally on your device by default. Location data is only used for real-time weather inquiries.\n\n5. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nFitCheck does not guarantee uninterrupted service. It cannot be held responsible for data loss caused by changing devices or deleting the application.\n\n6. CONTACT\nFor questions, reach out via the contact section in the Settings tab or at support@fitcheckapp.com.\n\n--- 📜 END OF AGREEMENT ---\nPlease accept the terms by pressing the button below.",
